* Chainlink CCIP
** Onchain components
*** Router 1.2.0, immutable entry point
*** OnRamp / OffRamp per chain
*** FeeQuoter: prices, gas caps
*** RMN: curse switch
*** TokenAdminRegistry: token -> pool
** v1.6 (v1.5: per-lane ramps + CommitStore)
*** Role DON, two OCR plugins
*** Commit: merkle roots on OffRamp
*** Execute: merkle proofs
*** NonceManager, in-order option
*** manual execution, 8 h window
** v2.0
*** Cross-Chain Verifiers (CCVs)
*** CommitteeVerifier = former DON
*** receiver + pool + lane quorum
*** permissionless executors
*** messageId = hash of MessageV1
*** no NonceManager, RMN curse-only
left side
** Messages
*** EVM2AnyMessage / Any2EVMMessage
*** extraArgs V1, V2, V3
*** finality or opt-in FTF
** Tokens
*** burn/mint, lock/release
*** ERC20LockBox (1.6.4+)
*** CCT self-serve registration
*** rate limiter token buckets
*** decimals: round down, dust lost
** Integrators
*** only Router calls ccipReceive
*** check (chain, sender) pair
*** do not revert, store and retry
*** gas limit not refunded
*** FAILURE is retryable
@endmindmap
